{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/228ae4dedb95794e7be7aed466376807.avif?t=1755202630\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The earth\u2019s resources are depleted, and the energy crisis is imminent. But there is still hope \u2013 the discovery of a distant world, which is rich in a new kind of natural energy resource. The name of the new world is \u201cGrimstar\u201d. That is where your brother lost his life, and the laws of the company he worked for require you to take his place until his contract is fulfilled. So you set out to do your service and to discover more about your brother's death.... Grimstar is a real-time strategy game about exploiting a foreign planet as efficiently as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/4ab99bf56665eafda6a8c086f9991e95.poster.avif?t=1755202630\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/4ab99bf56665eafda6a8c086f9991e95.webm?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/4ab99bf56665eafda6a8c086f9991e95.mp4?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/10bd9f7a2b16875424ccbea37813db30.avif?t=1755202630\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign: Exciting single-player campaign: which also revolves around finding out more about the death of your brother. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up system: With every mission you play, you level up and unlock valuable upgrades and new units and buildings with which you can exploit the planet even more efficiently.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/8db1cead9d6b8c75fe5b842881f2d894.poster.avif?t=1755202630\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/8db1cead9d6b8c75fe5b842881f2d894.webm?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/8db1cead9d6b8c75fe5b842881f2d894.mp4?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Planets: There are 3 different planets to choose from, each of which is unlocked upon reaching a higher level. Each planet has its own vegetation and special characteristics. The missions on each planet have different victory conditions: Either all crystals must be mined or alien artifacts must be collected. In addition, there are various command missions in between, during which special objectives must be fulfilled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero units: There are various hero units in the game, which once called can be called anew in every mission without giving up resources. The hero units also level up and thus become stronger after each mission. And as soon as they level up enough, they get new weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/22336f117f46ceaa6d85f7d4e725d218.poster.avif?t=1755202630\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/22336f117f46ceaa6d85f7d4e725d218.webm?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/22336f117f46ceaa6d85f7d4e725d218.mp4?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and exploit: Explore the alien planets and harvest all the resources to make your company a success. Command your armies against the alien hordes of the enemy planet as effectively as possible and using as few resources as possible. The more resources you have left at the end, the higher your level. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"promotion \"First Lieutenant\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1631230/5dd41effb5b7cd6e3ac97721ebdb116321fcca0b.jpg"},{"name":"promotion \"Second Lieutenant\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1631230/40de31beb588501b093af3c80be8813395a0e88b.jpg"},{"name":"promotion \"Captain\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1631230/bd86600760f940073fca5e06299fd9766ddc8b04.jpg"},{"name":"promotion \"Major\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1631230/c34d24932766c5d3e1f6b94c6fd8a9fe4d0adae0.jpg"},{"name":"promotion \"Lieutenant Colone\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1631230/6ec9110ec7b4cf49ad0681f2ab9a378126773caa.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1631230?t=1755202630","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755202630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/043ec07a84feb4dd1a1310f8265006dcf6022a25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755202630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/043ec07a84feb4dd1a1310f8265006dcf6022a25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755202630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Cartoon Violence, Blood"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/228ae4dedb95794e7be7aed466376807.avif?t=1755202630\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The earth\u2019s resources are depleted, and the energy crisis is imminent. But there is still hope \u2013 the discovery of a distant world, which is rich in a new kind of natural energy resource. The name of the new world is \u201cGrimstar\u201d. That is where your brother lost his life, and the laws of the company he worked for require you to take his place until his contract is fulfilled. So you set out to do your service and to discover more about your brother's death.... Grimstar is a real-time strategy game about exploiting a foreign planet as efficiently as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/4ab99bf56665eafda6a8c086f9991e95.poster.avif?t=1755202630\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/4ab99bf56665eafda6a8c086f9991e95.webm?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/4ab99bf56665eafda6a8c086f9991e95.mp4?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/10bd9f7a2b16875424ccbea37813db30.avif?t=1755202630\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign: Exciting single-player campaign: which also revolves around finding out more about the death of your brother. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up system: With every mission you play, you level up and unlock valuable upgrades and new units and buildings with which you can exploit the planet even more efficiently.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/8db1cead9d6b8c75fe5b842881f2d894.poster.avif?t=1755202630\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/8db1cead9d6b8c75fe5b842881f2d894.webm?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/8db1cead9d6b8c75fe5b842881f2d894.mp4?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Planets: There are 3 different planets to choose from, each of which is unlocked upon reaching a higher level. Each planet has its own vegetation and special characteristics. The missions on each planet have different victory conditions: Either all crystals must be mined or alien artifacts must be collected. In addition, there are various command missions in between, during which special objectives must be fulfilled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero units: There are various hero units in the game, which once called can be called anew in every mission without giving up resources. The hero units also level up and thus become stronger after each mission. And as soon as they level up enough, they get new weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/22336f117f46ceaa6d85f7d4e725d218.poster.avif?t=1755202630\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/22336f117f46ceaa6d85f7d4e725d218.webm?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/extras/22336f117f46ceaa6d85f7d4e725d218.mp4?t=1755202630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and exploit: Explore the alien planets and harvest all the resources to make your company a success. Command your armies against the alien hordes of the enemy planet as effectively as possible and using as few resources as possible. The more resources you have left at the end, the higher your level. </p></li></ul>","developers":["SvenRahn Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631230/b386f0fab71c44dc19d798bc6a7ac04feab99939/header.jpg?t=1755202630","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 SvenRahn Games & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1631230/515258536/86bc0cd6e03c1a7d9d115c9b51aea323e30ace83/1751011890/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750089449","dash_h264":"ht